{"id":"9e014b6b595b8bd9","group":"90","path":"90/90-ex-cantor-diagonal.md","title":"Cantor's Diagonal Argument","display":"ex-cantor-diagonal — Cantor's Diagonal Argument","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-ex-cantor-diagonal","aliases":["90-ex-cantor-diagonal"],"display":"ex-cantor-diagonal — Cantor's Diagonal Argument","depends_on":["[[90-df-cantor-diagonal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-ex-cantor-diagonal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-ex-cantor-diagonal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-cantor-diagonal — Cantor's Diagonal Argument"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dfc7cea11adbf92d\" href=\"?note=dfc7cea11adbf92d\" title=\"90-df-cantor-diagonal\">90-df-cantor-diagonal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (purported enumeration of binary sequences)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(g:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(n)=1-f(n)(n)\">\\(g(n)=1-f(n)(n)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}diagonal}\\ \\vdash\\\ng\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\n\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;g\\ne f(m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}diagonal}\\ \\vdash\\\ng\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\n\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;g\\ne f(m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>，在坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 上有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(m)\\ne f(m)(m)\">\\(g(m)\\ne f(m)(m)\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\ne f(m)\">\\(g\\ne f(m)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>因此任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 都不是满射。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-cantor-diagonal","status":"resolved","id":"dfc7cea11adbf92d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-cantor-diagonal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"g(n)=1-f(n)(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}diagonal}\\ \\vdash\\\ng\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\n\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;g\\ne f(m).","display":true},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"g(m)\\ne f(m)(m)","display":false},{"tex":"g\\ne f(m)","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}","display":false}],"bytes":775,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-ex-berry-paradox-formal.md]]\n[[90-ex-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-ex-diagonalization-method.md]]\n[[90-ex-godel-sentence-construction.md]]\n[[90-ex-quine-construction.md]]\n[[90-ex-quine-sentence.md]]\n[[90-ex-rosser-sentence-construction.md]]\n[[90-ex-russell-paradox-set.md]]\n[[90-ex-self-reference-program.md]]"}],"outgoing":["dfc7cea11adbf92d"]}